## How it was tested

On upstream `main` 829b9477d + this branch (dev build, Docker, upstream's `./gradlew`): compile, `spotlessCheck` pass, `installDist`, and the server boots to "Server ready". `tools/scripts/fix_gameval_conflicts.py --check`: no conflicts.

Not yet checked in game from this exact branch; the same handler (from the earlier #367) runs on our own test server.

No test added (a simple op handler; AGENTS.md).

