## Screenshots / notes for reviewers

Data sources: OSRS Wiki (by the wiki's contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/): Goblin Diplomacy, Walkthrough ("You can go up the only ladder in the goblin village, up there will be some crates."). Quest Helper `GoblinDiplomacy` (BSD): `goUpLadder` on loc 16450 at (2954, 3497, 0), the `upstairs` zone on plane 2, `goDownLadder` on 16556. Cache: the three locs' ops.

Known gap: the landing tile is the player's own tile on the other level; the exact OSRS tile isn't documented.

Release note: the Goblin Village lookout ladder can be climbed.

